{"v":4,"catch":"能在Nintendo Switch遊玩的Game Boy遊戲集","desc":"集合各式各樣Game Boy和Game Boy Color遊戲的Nintendo Switch Online加入者限定遊戲軟體《Game Boy™ – Nintendo Classics》。\n\n只要從選擇作品畫面選擇想要遊玩的遊戲便能立即啟動。可在不同遊戲之間切換遊玩。設有隨時隨地儲存和倒回等便利功能，就算只有一點空閒時間也可輕鬆遊玩。\n\n此外，遊戲畫面可從Game Boy、Game Boy pocket和Game Boy Color（僅限專用遊戲）3種之中選擇。除了鄰近主機通訊遊玩，線上遊玩亦支援最多2人遊玩，可和朋友一起享受對戰或協力遊玩。\n※因應玩家人數，需要準備同樣數量的Nintendo Switch主機。各玩家亦需要加入Nintendo Switch Online。","publisher":"Nintendo","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["其他"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 本機通訊 2 人 · 網路 2 人","langs":["日文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/334d26fa3c9f46fb45f1cf09e6cb31b97505def407df1d875558bbd0803061ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f34270d8787f83977ad41d0ff5c682d2f4189d36d693e6798e08f9d2a9c4613.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81806096701cc933507c63b315d9b911c03851df09cbba5eb74fbac6c4552c66.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b6ff961f5447a595b51a7719fb626bc5fe18207e81bb68a24e2dd0b97c009d9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e297ed4d224587306faa4e326e570b88be60208ef4cb0b82670b789ac647443.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d82b13d67c574645436b8a6be4ad05aeee87b957b2f3971b5a1b580d7eae244.jpg"],"titleId":"0100395011044000","dlc":[],"vids":["Jg0L7UUD5uI","EV5Q31y211s","Kbe-D76w6AI","SKRJujnuPic","1cERU5hNbLc","eIeJqzUKtlU","lKCzKvt11PE","TX-qrEZFXGQ","E__DfOyThDk","VxefnwmJlhc","T4czuDKwgc8","eRFQwugVhlQ","V6fpgaOQvFY","n_VpHvss_Ck","uyny3VKL6zw","5HayYHBKN1Q","1FDY3BR7Egg"]}